    <string name="disclaimer_title">Before you start</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_heading">Recording people requires their consent</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_body">In many countries it is illegal to record a conversation without the consent of the people being recorded. Laws differ from one place to another, and it is up to you to know and respect the rules that apply to you.

FossRec is a tool. You alone are responsible for how you use it. The developer accepts no liability for any misuse, or for any legal consequence of recordings made with this app.</string>
